        {
          "id": "2e797771-2593-37ac-a0fe-14b74e1a83f8",
          "content": {
            "id": "2e797771-2593-37ac-a0fe-14b74e1a83f8",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Nvidia partners with Palantir, Uber, & more, easing AI bubble fear",
            "description": "<p>Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) CEO Jensen Huang announced a slew of partnerships at the artificial intelligence (AI) chipmaker's annual conference, including with the <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/nvidia-to-sell-thousands-of-gpus-to-us-labs-as-part-of-sovereign-ai-push-183036987.html\">US Department of Energy</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/nvidia-and-uber-team-up-to-develop-network-of-self-driving-cars-174919826.html\">Uber</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UBER\">UBER</a>), <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/nvidia-says-eli-lilly-will-purchase-more-than-1000-gpus-to-power-drug-discovery-efforts-183013142.html\">Eli Lilly</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LLY\">LLY</a>), <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/palantir-nvidia-team-operationalize-ai-173600187.html\">Palantir</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PLTR\">PLTR</a>), <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/nvidias-huang-showcases-ai-latest-180803550.html\">CrowdStrike</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWD\">CRWD</a>), and more.</p>\n<p>Futurum CEO Daniel Newman joins Market Domination to discuss what the new partnerships mean for Nvidia and the AI space at large.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Nvidia (NVDA) CEO Jensen Huang announced a slew of partnerships at the artificial intelligence (AI) chipmaker's annual conference, including with the US Department of Energy, Uber (UBER), Eli Lilly (LLY), Palantir (PLTR), CrowdStrike (CRWD), and more. Futurum CEO Daniel Newman joins Market Domination to discuss what the new partnerships mean for Nvidia and the AI space at large. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination.",
